    "subtitle": "Receive expert facet joint disorder therapy at Heal Stride Physiotherapy & Wellness Centre. Modern physiotherapy, targeted rehabilitation and non-surgical pain relief for the spine with the help of experts.",
    "summary": "Heal Stride Physiotherapy offers sophisticated, non-surgical therapies for facet joint disorders. Our skilled spine physiotherapy, together with specific rehabilitation programmes, reduces inflamm...",
