    "title": "Rheumatoid Arthritis Treatment",
    "subtitle": "Manage Joint Pain &amp; Inflammation with expert Rheumatoid Arthritis treatment focused on mobility, stiffness reduction, strength, and improving everyday comfort.",
    "summary": "Stiffness in the morning that lasts well over an hour, not just a few minutes; swelling along with pain in the same small joints in both hands, and tiredness that feels deeper than...",
