        "question": "Is it possible for a slipped disc to happen in the neck, like the lower back?",
        "answer": "The lower back is the most common site for this issue. But slip disc may occur in the neck as well, with symptoms like stiffness, pain, or radiating symptoms in the shoulder and arms."
